{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16815","headline":"墙阴残雪 · 何频瑜","name":"墙阴残雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积雪还因地，墙阴久尚残。\n影添斜月白，光借夕阳寒。\n皎洁开帘近，清荧步履看。\n状花飞着树，如玉不成盘。\n冰薄方宁及，霜浓比亦难。\n谁怜高卧处，岁暮叹袁安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何频瑜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}